  "steps": [
    "Marinate. Toss the chicken with the spices, oil, salt, pepper and lime juice. Cover and chill at least 30 minutes (ideally 2–3 hours).",
    "Prep. Cook the rice. Preheat the oven to 425 °F.",
    "Veg. Toss zucchini, onion and corn with oil, salt, pepper and paprika.",
    "Bake. Nestle the chicken among the veg on a sheet pan. Bake 20 minutes (to 165 °F), then broil 5 minutes to crisp the corn.",
    "Crema. Blend all the crema ingredients until smooth.",
    "Serve. Sprinkle with cotija; serve over rice and greens with cilantro, more cheese, lime and crema."
